# "Whenever you gain life, draw that many cards." Bot1 casts the Grimoire on turn 1 (a hand of six), draws a Lightning Helix on
# turn 3 and casts it at Bot2: gaining 3 life (23) draws exactly three cards, and the 3 damage Bot2 takes is Bot2's life
# loss, not Bot1's, so Bot1 discards nothing (hand: 6 + the turn's draw - the Helix + 3 = 9; Grimoire's text only watches
# its controller's life).

